## Slide 24

Batching Script Events 

The following transitions are monitored by the Logic Service for Batching records…
On Job Start/End
On Batch Start/End
On Batch Step Start/End
On Batch Step Overage Start
TrakSYS allows for these transitions to be used to trigger real-time functionality such as…
Email Notifications
Entity Script Class Events

